  "$comment": [
    "RFC 0212 — cross-language vectors for canonical JSON (RFC 8785 JCS) with the OpenWOP I-JSON refusal set.",
    "Every signed or hashed preimage in the corpus MUST reproduce `canonical` and `sha256` for each `objects` entry, `canonical` for each `numbers` entry, and MUST refuse each `refusals` entry with a refusal (the `refuse` kind is informative).",
    "Generated by a reference implementation that parses JSON TEXT (so duplicates, integer magnitude and lone surrogates are visible before coercion) and cross-checked against RFC 8785 Appendix B and §3.2.2/§3.2.3."
  ],
